@startuml UC56B_RealtimeNotifications
!theme plain
title UC56B: Realtime notifications

actor User as "Customer/Staff/Admin"
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Socket.IO Server" as Socket
participant "Backend API" as API

User -> Frontend: Mở ứng dụng
Frontend -> Socket: Connect Socket.IO\n(auth: { token })

Socket -> API: Verify JWT token
API --> Socket: User authenticated

Socket -> Socket: Join user vào room\n(userId: user._id)
Socket -> Socket: Join role room\n(role: user.role)
Socket --> Frontend: Connected\n(event: "connect")

' ========== Nhận notification mới ==========
Socket -> Socket: Có notification mới\n(event: "new_notification")
Socket --> Frontend: Emit "new_notification"\n{ notification data }

Frontend -> Frontend: Update UI\n(hiển thị notification, badge)
Frontend --> User: Hiển thị notification\n(toast, badge, sound)

' ========== Fallback polling khi mất kết nối ==========
alt Socket disconnected
    Socket --> Frontend: Disconnected\n(event: "disconnect")
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: Start polling interval
    Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/notifications/unread-count\n(polling mỗi 30s)
    
    API -> API: Verify JWT token
    API -> DB: Query unread count
    DB --> API: Unread count
    
    API --> Frontend: Unread count
    Frontend --> User: Cập nhật badge
    
    alt Socket reconnected
        Socket --> Frontend: Reconnected\n(event: "reconnect")
        Frontend -> Frontend: Stop polling
        Frontend -> Socket: Rejoin rooms
    end
end

' ========== Cập nhật unread count ==========
Socket -> Socket: Unread count updated\n(event: "unread-count-updated")
Socket --> Frontend: Emit "unread-count-updated"\n{ totalUnread: number }

Frontend -> Frontend: Update badge
Frontend --> User: Cập nhật số lượng unread
@enduml

